## Output example

**Import data:**

```julia; eval = false
pkdata2  = CSV.File(
joinpath(dirname(pathof(MetidaNCA)), "..", "test", "csv", "pkdata2.csv")
) |> DataFrame
ds = pkimport(pkdata2, :Time, :Concentration, [:Subject, :Formulation];
